  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Design and supervision of construction/renovation of the biosafety level 3 laboratory and the regional offices of the Kosovo Food and Veterinary Agency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The general objective of the project is to provide a safe food to the consumers, to improve trade and to achieve a progress in the alignment to the EU standards regarding the food safety through improvement of animal health and phytosanitary conditions in Kosovo.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
